{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02907",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.66,
      "end_seconds": 2.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.32,
      "end_seconds": 8.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 9.5,
      "end_seconds": 12.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Doctor, thank you for seeing us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.74,
      "end_seconds": 17.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Yes, that's no problem at all. Please sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.39,
      "end_seconds": 28.63,
      "duration_seconds": 8.24,
      "text": "Yeah, it's a growing red ring on my thigh. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.7,
      "end_seconds": 35.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.41,
      "end_seconds": 38.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "It's been ten days now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.78,
      "end_seconds": 42.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.9,
      "end_seconds": 58.93,
      "duration_seconds": 15.03,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get tiredness as well. Uh, and there's aching muscles as well, one week now. The tiredness? That's been since last weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.75,
      "end_seconds": 68.85,
      "duration_seconds": 8.1,
      "text": "Have you had a growing red ring on your thigh before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.7,
      "end_seconds": 75.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "A bit, last year. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.18,
      "end_seconds": 83.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "Did you get joint swelling, stiff neck, palpitations or facial weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.28,
      "end_seconds": 90.94,
      "duration_seconds": 5.66,
      "text": "No, no joint swelling, stiff neck, palpitations or facial weakness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.14,
      "end_seconds": 96.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.27,
      "end_seconds": 100.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.91,
      "end_seconds": 122.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.41,
      "end_seconds": 132.52,
      "duration_seconds": 9.11,
      "text": "I've had diabetes for about ten years now. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.61,
      "end_seconds": 135.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Yes, carry on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.86,
      "end_seconds": 141.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "I have eczema, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.32,
      "end_seconds": 143.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Any other things?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.12,
      "end_seconds": 157.72,
      "duration_seconds": 9.6,
      "text": "Right, so diabetes is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 159.45,
      "end_seconds": 161.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "It's glibenclamide, before breakfast, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.54,
      "end_seconds": 164.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 165.77,
      "end_seconds": 169.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "5 milligrams. He takes hydrocortisone cream, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.24,
      "end_seconds": 173.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Okay, anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.08,
      "end_seconds": 177.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.5,
      "end_seconds": 181.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "What line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.04,
      "end_seconds": 189.04,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.65,
      "end_seconds": 194.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.91,
      "end_seconds": 201.51,
      "duration_seconds": 5.6,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.95,
      "end_seconds": 206.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.06,
      "end_seconds": 212.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Mm, uh, my grandfather had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.36,
      "end_seconds": 217.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.31,
      "end_seconds": 224.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "Yes, I had my tonsils removed, as a teenager."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.16,
      "end_seconds": 239.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.47,
      "end_seconds": 245.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.48,
      "end_seconds": 249.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.98,
      "end_seconds": 258.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.69,
      "end_seconds": 287.27,
      "duration_seconds": 7.58,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 72, saturation 97 percent, blood pressure 113 over 69, respiratory rate 15, temp 36.8 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.33,
      "end_seconds": 289.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.14,
      "end_seconds": 293.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "That's fine, I'll explain it soon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.36,
      "end_seconds": 300.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 313.33,
      "end_seconds": 314.03,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.04,
      "end_seconds": 317.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.51,
      "end_seconds": 336.91,
      "duration_seconds": 6.4,
      "text": "There is an expanding ring-shaped red patch, about eight centimetres across, on the thigh."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.69,
      "end_seconds": 365.36,
      "duration_seconds": 24.67,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. From what you've told me and what I found, the most likely explanation is early Lyme disease. We shouldn't forget cellulitis. The treatment will be doxycycline, 100 milligrams, twice a day, twenty-one days. You take it by mouth. That's for early Lyme disease. Take the doxycycline with food and avoid strong sun."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 365.9,
      "end_seconds": 375.65,
      "duration_seconds": 9.75,
      "text": "Yes, carry on. Can you tell me the plan back in your own words, so I know I've explained it clearly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 378.34,
      "end_seconds": 385.37,
      "duration_seconds": 7.03,
      "text": "So, I take the doxycycline, 100 milligrams, twice a day. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 387.09,
      "end_seconds": 392.43,
      "duration_seconds": 5.34,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Alright, anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 396.42,
      "end_seconds": 397.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 399.29,
      "end_seconds": 400.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
}